#end
#if( $externalHomeUrl )
* <a href="${externalHomeUrl}" title="Product website" target="_blank">Product website</a>
#end

#else

**Download (Windows):**

#if( $hasZip )
* <a href="${appsDownloadBase}/${path}/${version}/${archiveName}-${version}.zip">$downloadName (Portable ZIP — bundled runtime)</a>
#end

### How to run on Windows

#if( $hasZip )
1. Download the **Portable ZIP**.
2. Unzip the archive to a local folder.
3. Open the unzipped folder (named **`${archiveName}`**).
4. Double-click **`${archiveName}.exe`** (same layout as EzDojo portable: `AppName.exe`, `app/`, `runtime/`).
#end

Prefer the portable ZIP: it bundles a custom Java runtime via jpackage, so no separate JDK install is required.

Press **F11** to toggle fullscreen.

#if( $isPresentation )
### Presentation controls

* Open Menu: Double Touch, Middle Mouse click
* Next Slide: Mouse Left-click, Page Down, Swipe Left
* Previous Slide: Mouse Right-click, Page Up, Swipe Right
* Next Slide (skip step): Ctrl + Mouse Left-Click, Ctrl + Page Down, Double Swipe Left
* Previous Slide (skip step): Ctrl + Mouse Right-click, Ctrl + Page Up, Double Swipe Right

#end

#end

